        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9af0780c-29a8-47a3-9d36-669ab2028113).Image",
        "Description": "The Client, Carl Ingram, has been victimised by the &quot;banana thieves&quot; of the Burj Al-Ghazali. He has reported that on multiple occasions, he has brought in a &quot;bunch&quot; of bananas to the building for his personal consumption, even leaving a post it note on its stem, reading &quot;Ingram&apos;s Bananas! Do not touch!&quot;, only to find his bananas missing by the time he goes to eat them. Examining the  building&apos;s camera footage has confirmed the culprits. Collect atleast 3 stolen bananas, and kill their abductors.",
